<h2 id="what-is-gohighlevel">🔍 What Is GoHighLevel?</h2>

GoHighLevel (GHL) is an all-in-one sales and marketing platform built for agencies and multi-location businesses. It combines CRM, email marketing, SMS, phone systems, landing pages, appointment scheduling, reputation management, and pipeline tracking into a single white-label platform.

The platform operates on a sub-account model. You pay one monthly fee and create unlimited location accounts underneath. Each location gets its own isolated environment with dedicated phone numbers, pipelines, and automations. This architecture matters because it's what makes GHL viable at scale—unlike per-seat CRMs that become cost-prohibitive past 10 locations.

Originally designed for marketing agencies managing client accounts, GHL has evolved into a legitimate operations platform for franchise operators, regional service chains, and holding companies managing multiple brands. The 2025-2026 updates added workflow improvements, AI appointment booking, and enhanced reporting that address previous enterprise gaps.

